{{!
    @template local_pshub/catalogue

    The public catalogue: a search field, filter chips, and a grid of courses.

    EVERY FILTER IS A LINK. Not a select that needs JavaScript to submit, not a
    checkbox that needs a handler - a link to the same page with one parameter
    changed. That is what makes a filtered view shareable, the back button
    work, and the page usable with scripting off (AC-20). The search box is a
    GET form with a visible submit button for the same reason.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * searchvalue - What is currently in the search box.
    * actionurl - Where the search form submits.
    * hiddenfields - [{name, value}] other filters, carried through the search.
    * groups - [{label, chips: [{url, label, active}]}]
    * total, count - The result line.
    * courses - Card contexts, see catalogue_service::present().
    * hasresults - bool
    * hasfilters, clearurl - The "clear filters" link.
    * paging - Rendered paging bar HTML.
    * inapp - True inside the learner's shell, where the search lives in the top bar.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "searchvalue": "",
        "actionurl": "/local/pshub/catalogue.php",
        "hiddenfields": [],
        "groups": [{"label": "Language", "chips": [{"url": "?", "label": "All", "active": true}]}],
        "count": "4 courses",
        "courses": [],
        "hasresults": false,
        "hasfilters": false,
        "clearurl": "/local/pshub/catalogue.php",
        "paging": ""
    }
}}
{{!
    Inside the learner's space the shell already carries a search box and the
    brand, so the page says who it is and gets out of the way. A visitor gets
    the full band: they have just arrived and nothing else on screen has told
    them what this list is.
}}
{{#inapp}}
    <div class="ps-page__head">
        <span class="ps-page__eyebrow">{{#str}}catalogue, local_pshub{{/str}}</span>
        <h1 class="ps-page__title">{{#str}}catalogue_explore, local_pshub{{/str}}</h1>
    </div>
{{/inapp}}
{{^inapp}}
<section class="ps-cathead">
    <div class="ps-cathead__inner">
        <div class="ps-cathead__copy">
            <h1 class="ps-cathead__title">{{#str}}catalogue, local_pshub{{/str}}</h1>
            <p class="ps-cathead__lede">{{#str}}catalogue_lede, local_pshub{{/str}}</p>
        </div>

        <form class="ps-search" method="get" action="{{actionurl}}">
            {{#hiddenfields}}
                <input type="hidden" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}">
            {{/hiddenfields}}
            <label class="ps-search__label" for="ps-q">{{#str}}filter_search, local_pshub{{/str}}</label>
            <input class="ps-search__input" type="search" id="ps-q" name="q" value="{{searchvalue}}"
                   placeholder="{{#str}}filter_search_placeholder, local_pshub{{/str}}">
            <button class="ps-btn ps-btn--blue" type="submit">{{#str}}filter_apply, local_pshub{{/str}}</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</section>
{{/inapp}}

<section class="ps-section ps-catalogue">
    <div class="ps-section__inner">

        <div class="ps-filters">
            {{#groups}}
                <div class="ps-filters__group">
                    <span class="ps-filters__label">{{label}}</span>
                    <div class="ps-filters__chips">
                        {{#chips}}
                            <a class="ps-chip {{#active}}ps-chip--on{{/active}}" href="{{url}}"
                               {{#active}}aria-current="true"{{/active}}>{{label}}</a>
                        {{/chips}}
                    </div>
                </div>
            {{/groups}}
        </div>

        <div class="ps-catalogue__count">
            <span>{{count}}</span>
            {{#hasfilters}}
                <a class="ps-catalogue__clear" href="{{clearurl}}">{{#str}}filter_clear, local_pshub{{/str}}</a>
            {{/hasfilters}}
        </div>

        {{#hasresults}}
            <div class="ps-course-grid">
                {{#courses}}
                    {{> local_pshub/course_card }}
                {{/courses}}
            </div>
            <div class="ps-catalogue__paging">{{{paging}}}</div>
        {{/hasresults}}
        {{^hasresults}}
            <p class="ps-empty">{{#str}}catalogue_empty, local_pshub{{/str}}</p>
        {{/hasresults}}

    </div>
</section>
